```json
{"poe":"step","name":"interface-compliance","detail":"Checking proposed function interfaces and event handling against CONOPS workflow. No wire protocol or Tauri/Rust layer — this is a vanilla JS browser game. Function API surface: isValidGuess(), scoreGuess(), submitGuess(), renderRow(), checkGameOver(). Checking against CONOPS §5 workflow steps."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"schema-compliance","detail":"No database schema — fully client-side. Checking word corpus structure and in-memory state model against conops.md and must-nots.md constraints instead."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"task-sizing","detail":"Reviewing all 12 tasks for right-sizing — single-agent, approximately 1-4 hours of focused work each. Checking for undeclared epics or tasks without acceptance criteria."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"dependency-completeness","detail":"Tracing all 19 declared edges for directional correctness, completeness, and cycle absence. Verifying all implementation tasks reach t11 before audit."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"skill-assignments","detail":"Verifying frontend/test/senior-engineer assignments against task types."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"coverage","detail":"Checking for missing tasks: tests, must-not controls, CSS class definitions, cross-browser coverage. Counting must-not identifiers against the plan's stated count."}
```

Now I'll write the review artifact:

