{"poe":"done","summary":"Review complete. Verdict: APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Two WARNs: (1) t11 compliance audit must cover all 16 enumerated MN identifiers, not the self-contradictory stated count of 14; (2) t6 renderRow must apply both textContent for letter content and classList for color state — the task description conflates the two. No BLOCKs. DAG is valid, all tasks right-sized, must-not controls properly distributed."}
